# Wave W17-M (Route 107): swell rock — a reef-shadow rock barely breaking the surface: a low dark green-grey back awash in the swell, foam breaking right over its crown, most of the tile still open sea (design: reef shadows under the surface of the open swell). Route 107’s own rock — the lowest, wettest rock in the arc.
